From: Harshit Gupta <39994376+arelyx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:11:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 30/31] freedreno: save the blitter's scissor with exclusive
 bounds; readback blits from 128x128

- ctx->scissor keeps inclusive max bounds, but the blitter restores the saved
  scissor through set_scissor_states(), which takes exclusive ones: every
  scissored blit shrank the application's scissor by one pixel. Xenos blits
  are always scissored now, which made four dEQP fragment_ops.scissor cases
  fail.
- New cap readpixels_blit_min_pixels (Xenos: 128x128, XENOS_READ_BLIT_MIN_PIXELS):
  fbo.render.color.blend_npot_rbo_bgra_depth_component16 read 16 wrong rows by
  blit at 111x122 when run after the other fbo.render.color cases. Not
  understood; the CPU path is used below 128x128.
- Cached readback staging: dcbf the whole BO.

